    <system:String x:Key="Str_HardwareSensors_AdminTitle">Some sensors need administrator rights</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HardwareSensors_AdminWarning">Running as a standard user, CPU and motherboard sensors (temperatures, voltages, fans) and drive SMART data can't be read, so they're missing or show 0. Restart as administrator to read them.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HardwareSensors_AdminAndDriverWarning">Running as a standard user, CPU and motherboard sensors (temperatures, voltages, fans) and drive SMART data can't be read, so they're missing or show 0. Restart as administrator to read drive data; CPU and motherboard sensors also need the PawnIO driver (pawnio.eu) installed.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HardwareSensors_DriverTitle">CPU and motherboard sensors need the PawnIO driver</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_HardwareSensors_DriverWarning">LibreHardwareMonitor reads CPU and motherboard temperatures, voltages and fans through the PawnIO driver, which isn't installed on this PC - so they're missing or show 0. Install it, then reopen this page.</system:String>
