    <system:String x:Key="Str_Monitor_VerdictMismatch">Windows reports {0} Hz but the screen refreshes at about {1:0.0} Hz. Check the refresh rate in Windows display settings and that the cable and port support it.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_Monitor_VerdictSmooth">Frames arrived evenly: nothing was missed.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_Monitor_VerdictStutter">Some frames came late. That is the computer being busy or power saving, not the screen. Close other programs and try again.</system:String>
