    <system:String x:Key="Str_PdfReader_CantOpenDetail">If it has a password, type it in the sidebar and press Unlock.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_PdfReader_CantOpenOther">Windows could not read this file: </system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_PdfReader_Idle">Open a PDF to read it, sign it or fill it in.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_PdfReader_IdleOpen">Add your signature, text, a date or a check mark, then save a copy.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_PdfReader_IdleDetail">Your original is never changed. The signed PDF is saved as a new file.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str_PdfReader_DiscardMarks">You have marks on the open PDF that are not saved. Open another PDF anyway?</system:String>
